'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml

title Preparing an edit before replacement
participant ":MishMash" as App
participant ":EditRecipeCommand" as Edit
participant ":RecipeBook" as Book
participant ":RecipeChanges" as Changes
participant ":RecipeViewer" as Viewer
App -> Edit : execute(book)
activate Edit
Edit -> Book : size()
activate Book
Book --> Edit : recipeCount
deactivate Book
note right of Edit : Continue only for a valid index.
Edit -> Book : getRecipes()
activate Book
Book --> Edit : recipe snapshot
deactivate Book
Edit -> Changes : applyTo(original)
activate Changes
note right of Changes
  Create a new Recipe;
  keep omitted fields.
end note
Changes --> Edit : edited recipe
deactivate Changes
Edit -> Viewer : view(edited)
activate Viewer
Viewer --> Edit : recipe details
deactivate Viewer
note right of Edit : Prepare complete feedback.
Edit -> Book : replace(index - 1, edited)
activate Book
Book --> Edit : return
deactivate Book
Edit --> App : feedback
deactivate Edit

@enduml
'@@author
